<BaseLayout title="MSU Index | Will Chai" description="A student governance document index proposed by Will Chai and Christopher Xenos." path="/msu/"><div class="pageShell"><SiteHeader current="projects" /><main id="main" class="pageMain"><article class="archiveRecord"><p>Project archive</p><h1>MSU Index</h1><p>The MSU Index was a 2026 prototype by Will Chai and Christopher Xenos for finding student governance documents. It brought together records such as bylaws, policies, meeting documents and transition reports.</p><p>The prototype supported searches across document titles, summaries, contents and tags. Its proposed assistant helped readers find relevant records and context.</p><p>This archival page describes the 2026 proposal and its document search approach.</p><p><a href="https://msumcmaster.ca/app/uploads/2026/03/ChristopherXenosForSpeakerUpdate.pdf">Read the contemporary project proposal</a>.</p><p><a href="/projects/">Explore current projects</a></p></article></main><SiteFooter /></div></BaseLayout>
